SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","鲜血法阵每秒造成伤害提升至80% + 8% ATK，法阵结束时造成的真实伤害提升至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","피의 마법진이 초당 입히는 대미지가 80% + 8% ATK로 증가한다. 마법진 종료 시 입히는 고정 대미지가 400% + 40% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","血蝠之唤"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","피의 박쥐"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","在“眷属”身周召唤蝙蝠群造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","권속 주변에 박쥐 떼를 소환해 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","苔佩希消耗当前生命的8%，在“眷属”身周召唤蝙蝠群，对周围2格的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，之后蝙蝠会在敌人身上寄生5秒，每秒造成48% + 6% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","테페시아가 현재 HP의 8%를 소모해 권속 주변에 박쥐 떼를 소환하고, 주변 2칸 범위 내 적군에게 240% + 30% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다. 이후 박쥐는 적군에게 5초 동안 기생해 초당 48% + 6% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":40,"end":46,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":75,"end":80,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spa